Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A destination, complete in itaelf", "text": "It is said that an uninterrupted visit to this site signifies that the human being has overcome her animal being. She is now beyond her needs of basal survivor needs. \nBack to the site. This is a huge complex, full of temples, havelis, ghats, and gardens. The main shrine alone could be a reason to visit Kathmandu. \nMust visit. Keep aside a whole day. Best to go for early morning darshan at 5am and then stay the for the Kirtan Jam sessions and other interesting rituals.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2014-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "D3572D908F825E3F8C8C8796FE63643C", "name": "Doyel K", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/doyelkar", "username": "doyelkar", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/01/bb/4c/7e/doyelkar.jpg", "contribution_count": 334, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 304558, "location_name": "Kolkata (Calcutta)", "location_name_detailed": "Kolkata (Calcutta), India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2015-02-05", "published_at_date": "2015-02-05"}, {"review_id": 252427383, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r252427383-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Best place to see a little bit of everything", "text": "Best place to see a bit of everything, busy streets, monks, temples, beautiful temple paintings everywhere", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2014-04-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "40B80DBDCF03AD5CCD38F61F6E2EEEA2", "name": "greenclover73", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/greenclover73", "username": "greenclover73", "avatar": null, "contribution_count": 14, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 39588, "location_name": "Lexington", "location_name_detailed": "Lexington, Kentucky"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2015-02-03", "published_at_date": "2015-02-03"}, {"review_id": 252364536, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r252364536-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "very impressive and a little creepy", "text": "It was very interresting to withness the rituals around the cremation of hindu-people. I also found it a little bit creepy and i felt a bit weird to be looking on during such a personal event. The tempels are also very nice to see and the walk to the top of the hill is tiring but worth your while. However, do not walk up or down the hill when is starts to get darker, the monkeys are aggressive sometimes. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2014-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "76C93E07B1442D0F8741D4F40F95CC70", "name": "Martine M", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/martinem376", "username": "martinem376", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/07/4a/12/c7/martine-m.jpg", "contribution_count": 7, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 188612, "location_name": "Utrecht Province", "location_name_detailed": "Utrecht Province, The Netherlands"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2015-02-03", "published_at_date": "2015-02-03"}, {"review_id": 252344957, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r252344957-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Experience beyond words!", "text": "A must visit place, not just for the Hindus but for everyone. Words cannot do justice to the feeling you get when you are in the temple. If you are in Kathmandu definitely visit this temple, you will understand why its so difficult to express it. \n\nWord of advice - Beware of guides and other people trying to sell you things. There are many shops outside selling prayer offerings, be sure to bargain with them. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "solo", "stay_date": "2015-01-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "001FB4E970A7912FEE2197AB26F7DE63", "name": "Anand_Wanderlover", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Anand_Wanderlover", "username": "Anand_Wanderlover", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/13/65/39/08/anand4frnz.jpg", "contribution_count": 188, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 297654, "location_name": "Pune", "location_name_detailed": "Pune, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2015-02-03", "published_at_date": "2015-02-02"}, {"review_id": 252174041, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r252174041-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Interesting ceremonies", "text": "Very interesting place to see hindu ceremonies. Go at night (after 6pm) and you dont have to pay the entrance fee. Also, non hindus are not allowed inside the main temple.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2014-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "5FB60920C78770E8CBF0E8E41C3D619D", "name": "Letícia B", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/131let_c